// Granted by Heroes/Lux's SentryAddFireRateSkillAction onto the caster - while present,
// SpawnSentrySkillAction copies this straight onto the spawned sentry itself (same component type,
// just now living on the sentry instead of the caster), so SentryAuraSystem can keep buffing nearby
// allies' attack speed (StatusEffectUtility.ApplyHaste) even once the caster who deployed this
// sentry is no longer around.
//
// Begin-only, deliberately not paired with End - same reasoning as every other "configures what the
// skill does" upgrade this session: re-granting fresh (idempotent) every activation and never
// removing it means it's simply always there once picked, with nothing to race against.
component SentryFireRateAuraUpgrade
{
    FP AttackSpeedMultiplier;
}
